Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Taisceadán nua: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault criptigh: message eochair: key.
>> decrypted := vault díchriptigh: encrypted eochair: key.

Aschur 
scríobh: ['Message:'], líne-nua
scríobh: message, líne-nua
scríobh: ['Decrypted:'], líne-nua
scríobh: decrypted, líne-nua.
